OL,3,ARussell Brand tells court allegations
OL,4,Amade friends and colleagues turn
OL,5,Aagainst him
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrand, 51, is accused of three counts
OL,8,Fof rape, three counts of sexual
OL,9,Fassault, and one charge of attempted
OL,10,Findecent assault.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/19
